# Environment secrets
.env
# .env.<name> are variants of the same thing (e.g. .env.openrouter) and
# contain real keys as well. The pattern has to be .env.* — a bare
# ".env" only matches the exact filename.
.env.*
# ...the template is, by exception, not a secret.
!.env.example

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# Build
target/
*.class
*.jar

# Request/response exchange logs
logs/
/.env
/target/
/.idea/
/logs/
/wf_prefixcache.md
